ing to express something important — the pain or weight of discussing loss, violence, or I see. \"Pain\" is a powerful word in this context. If you’re speaking about the *pain* of losing people, especially through death — whether it's from conflict, tragedy, or something deeply personal — that’s not just heavy; it's human. It's real. And it deserves (deserves) to be heard. ", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 68, "stopped": true}], "user_pieces": [{"kind": "partial", "text": "Okay, that's", "t_start": 1.58, "t_end": 2.7, "t_avail": 3.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "fair, because", "t_start": 2.7, "t_end": 3.12, "t_avail": 3.8000000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "that's...", "t_start": 3.12, "t_end": 3.58, "t_avail": 4.4, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "that's I I mean", "t_start": 3.4, "t_end": 4.56, "t_avail": 4.6000000000000005, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "I don't just want", "t_start": 4.6000000000000005, "t_end": 5.500000000000001, "t_avail": 6.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "to talk about,", "t_start": 5.500000000000001, "t_end": 6.120000000000001, "t_avail": 6.800000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "final", "text": "talk about, you know, I could not...", "t_start": 5.6000000000000005, "t_end": 7.380000000000001, "t_avail": 7.4, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "of killing of people and death.", "t_start": 7.4, "t_end": 9.56, "t_avail": 10.4, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "There's a moral issue", "t_start": 9.66, "t_end": 10.540000000000001, "t_avail": 11.200000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "final", "text": "issue too.", "t_start": 10.26, "t_end": 10.9, "t_avail": 11.8, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Do you,", "t_start": 11.8, "t_end": 12.8, "t_avail": 13.4, "en