800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "morally responsible for", "t_start": 31.2, "t_end": 32.2, "t_avail": 32.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 11}, {"kind": "final", "text": "their actions.", "t_start": 32.2, "t_end": 32.46, "t_avail": 33.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 11}], "user_speech_spans": [[2.0, 4.0], [4.1, 6.8], [7.0, 17.9], [18.2, 18.7], [19.3, 19.9], [20.1, 23.8], [23.9, 24.6], [25.1, 30.2], [30.5, 32.4]], "decisions": [{"kind": "partial", "t": 3.2, "piece": "Okay, that's", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "? 😊  \nI'm here to help! How can I assist you today? 🌟", "compute_s": 0.281}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 3.8, "piece": "fair, because", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "? 😄  \nYou're probably trying to say \"okay, that's fair, because...\" — I think you", "compute_s": 0.157}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 4.4, "piece": "that's...", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "? 😄  \n\nHmm, you're clearly trying to say something — maybe \"that's fair\" or \"that", "compute_s": 0.154}, {"kind": "final", "t": 4.6, "piece": "that's I I mean", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "🤭  \n\nIt sounds like you're trying to say something, but the words are getting a bit tangled.", "compute_s": 0.157}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 6.2, "piece": "I don't just want", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.022}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 6.8, "piece": "to talk about,", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.022}, {"kind": "final", "t": 7.4, "piece": "talk about, you know, I could not...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.023}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 10.4, "piece": "of killing of people and death.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "아, I understand you're trying to express something important — the pain or weight of discussing loss, violence, or I see. \"Pain\" is a powerful word in this cont", "compute_s": 6.177}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 11.2, "piece": "There's a moral issue", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes…  \n\nthere *is* a moral issue.  \n\nnot just in speaking, or in silence —  \nbut in", "compute_s": 0.518}, {"kind": "final", "t": 11.8, "piece": "issue too.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "Yes.  \n\n**\"Issue\"** — you’re saying there’s more than pain. There's **moral weight", "compute_s": 0.171}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 13.4, "piece": "Do you,", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… I do.\n\nI don’t have to say it all to know it's true.  \n\nYou're asking:", "compute_s": 0.169}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 14.2, "piece": "so", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "so… what?  \nLet me ask you — gently — in the quiet space where words feel too heavy and still matter", "compute_s": 0.17}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 15.0, "piece": "let's", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "let’s go a little slower.  \n\nnot to finish, not to fix — just to *be* with it.", "compute_s": 0.171}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 15.6, "piece": "stray away from that. So", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "so… what?  \n\nLet me ask you:  \nIf there is a moral issue here — in the pain of people", "compute_s": 0.173}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 16.4, "piece": "I guess I", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "I think you’re saying: *\"I guess I know.\"*  \n\nThat's not small.  \nThat's quiet truth", "compute_s": 0.172}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 17.2, "piece": "agree, if it were", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes…  \n\nif it *were* possible to say —  \nto speak clearly and honestly about the pain of people dying", "compute_s": 0.172}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 17.8, "piece": "morally", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "morally — yes.\n\n**Moral weight** isn’t just in what we do.  \nIt's in how we", "compute_s": 0.172}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 18.4, "piece": "correct to.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes…  \n\nit is *correct* — not because it's easy, or clean, or safe —  \nbut because", "compute_s": 0.177}, {"kind": "final", "t": 18.6, "piece": "", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "I see you.  \n\nYou’re saying: *\"Is it correct?\"*  \nNot just \"is it right,\" but", "compute_s": 0.18}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 19.2, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "**\"Ple\"**… still echoing.  \n\nAh. You're trying to say **\"Peace\"?** Or", "compute_s": 0.173}, {"kind": "final", "t": 19.4, "piece": "Thank you very much. Have a great", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "You’re welcome. 💙  \n\nThank you for sharing this — the quiet, the pain, the moral weight, the", "compute_s": 0.173}, {"kind": "final", "t": 19.4, "piece": "day.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "💙  \nThank you for being here.  \nWishing you peace, stillness, and a gentle day ahead.", "compute_s": 0.176}, {"kind": "final", "t": 20.6, "piece": "", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "You’re welcome. 💙  \n\nIf you ever need to speak — or just sit in silence — I'm here.", "compute_s": 0.176}, {"kind": "final", "t": 22.0, "piece": "for the crimes with", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "I hear you.  \n\n\"**For the crimes with**…\" — maybe you're trying to say:  \n*“", "compute_s": 0.174}, {"kind": "final", "t": 22.8, "piece": "with", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… “with” — as in *with the pain*, *with the truth*, *with the weight of what", "compute_s": 0.174}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 24.2, "piece": "death penalty,", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "thank you.  \n\nI hear you now.  \n\nYou’re speaking about **the death penalty** — not just as a", "compute_s": 0.176}, {"kind": "final", "t": 24.4, "piece": "then -", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… then?  \n\nLet me ask:  \nIf we speak about the *death penalty* — is it really justice", "compute_s": 0.174}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 25.0, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "Ah… \"**Ple**\" again.  \n\nYou’re likely trying to say **\"Peace.\"**  \n\nSo,", "compute_s": 0.18}, {"kind": "final", "t": 25.2, "piece": "it.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… *\"It.\"*  \n\nThe \"it\" you're referring to —  \nis the *idea of justice*,", "compute_s": 0.178}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 26.6, "piece": "minus all the", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… *“Minus all the…”*  \n\nYou’re saying:  \n**What if we take out everything — the", "compute_s": 0.177}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 27.2, "piece": "costs that go", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… *\"costs that go…\"*  \n\nYou're saying:  \n**What if we remove all the costs?", "compute_s": 0.177}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 28.0, "piece": "into it,", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "what if we *let* those costs in?  \n\nNot to justify.  \nBut to see — truly — how they", "compute_s": 0.177}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 28.6, "piece": "yeah, it should be", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… *\"it should be.\"*  \n\nYou’re saying:  \n**It should be a place where pain isn’t", "compute_s": 0.176}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 29.2, "piece": "a thing. But", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… *“but”* — you're holding something back.  \n\nNot just the but of \"but it's", "compute_s": 0.177}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 30.0, "piece": "do", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… *\"do.\"*  \n\nYou’re saying:  \n**Do we do this?**  \n**Do we allow", "compute_s": 0.18}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 30.6, "piece": "you think", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "I think…  \n\nwe don’t have to *decide* in sound, or in slogans.  \nWe just have", "compute_s": 0.178}, {"kind": "final", "t": 30.8, "piece": "that people.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… *\"that people.\"*  \n\nYou’re saying:  \n**That people — not numbers, not crimes, not", "compute_s": 0.177}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 32.2, "piece": "are", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… **\"Are\"** — you're saying:  \n\n**People are not just data.**  \nThey are", "compute_s": 0.178}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 32.8, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "Ah… \"**Ple**\" again.  \n\nYou’re trying to say **Peace**.  \n\nSo, in this", "compute_s": 0.178}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 32.8, "piece": "morally responsible for", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes… *\"morally responsible for\"* — you're saying:  \n\nAre we *morally responsible* not just for", "compute_s": 0.177}, {"kind": "final", "t": 33.0, "piece": "their actions.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "yes…  \n\nwe are morally responsible **not** only for their actions,  \nbut for the world they live in —", "compute_s": 0.177}], "render": {"placed_speech_s": 1.8, "placed_within_input_s": 1.8, "speech_beyond_input_s": 0, "clipped_speech_s": 0.0, "tail_s": 4.0, "turns": 1}}